.TH MUSETTE 1 "2026-11-27" "Musette" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
musette \- YouTube Music player for Linux phones
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B musette
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Musette is an unofficial YouTube Music client built on SimpMusic, with a
GTK 4 and libadwaita interface for Phosh.
Closing the window keeps the music playing; start
.B musette
again to show the window, or choose
.B Quit
in the window menu to stop playback and exit.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the Musette version and the SimpMusic version it is built on, then exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MUSETTE_OPEN
Comma-separated pages to open at start, for debugging: for example
.BR library ,
.BR nowplaying ,
.BR search:\fIquery\fP .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ${XDG_DATA_HOME:-~/.local/share}/musette
Account, history, library and settings.
.TP
.I ${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-~/.cache}/musette
Thumbnails and the log,
.IR run.log .
.SH BUGS
Report problems at https://github.com/x-vlad-x/musette/issues.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/x-vlad-x/musette
